00:51:48.920 --> 00:51:52.990
It's part of I could think of many other
sectors we could focus even

00:51:52.990 --> 00:51:56.390
more on but it's very important in my view
that those are, each of

00:51:56.390 --> 00:52:00.500
those sectors is at least ten to 15%, each
