00:52:00.500 --> 00:52:04.840
we do to ensure that everyone has a chance
to, to work in it.

00:52:04.840 --> 00:52:07.810
The second thing we've done is we've
opened up our model on [UNKNOWN]

00:52:07.810 --> 00:52:10.440
It used to be the case we weren't allowed
to do so on [UNKNOWN].

00:52:10.440 --> 00:52:13.370
When I was in Asia cause I was far away
from everyone I had

00:52:13.370 --> 00:52:15.680
the view I asked for forgiveness not

00:52:15.680 --> 00:52:17.890
permission, so I did them without
permission.

00:52:17.890 --> 00:52:20.634
I got in trouble a few times, but so
having people go

00:52:20.634 --> 00:52:26.810
and work at an NGO, right, for a year and
