00:52:36.330 --> 00:52:40.100
So we wanna ensure people, have those
opportunities

00:52:40.100 --> 00:52:41.990
for the [UNKNOWN] and we talk about them.

00:52:41.990 --> 00:52:44.430
In terms of of what we're doing and where
