00:53:01.270 --> 00:53:02.740
We're not that keen on, I mean, we like

00:53:02.740 --> 00:53:06.020
people doing, but not, probably, we're not
an incubator, so.

00:53:06.020 --> 00:53:08.150
We, but, what we do is and some people

00:53:08.150 --> 00:53:10.910
the way just wanna spend time with their
